'''Vermilingua Rangmaster''' (超舌獣ラングマスター, ''Chō Zetsujū Rangumasutā'', '''Super Tongue-Beast Rangmaster''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Master A.]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

