==Enemy==
This enemy is incredibly annoying. His DPS is pretty high for a midranger, and while he has a lower attack rate and effective range than Master A. (350 < 451), high-pierce [[Omni Strike]] allows him to advance seamlessly while tearing through your defenses. There aren't many [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercing units]] that can actually hit him safely. His extreme durability is no laughing matter either, having nearly 1 million base HP and a 400,000 HP [[Shield]] that regenerates by half each time he gets knocked back (effectively giving him up to another million HP). His [[Immune to Waves|Immunity to Waves]] and [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback]] make it even harder to regain ground from him, though this is somewhat balanced by having 4 damage knockbacks.

==Strategy==
Given that he usually comes with lots of nasty support enemies adding to the frontline pressure, you may want to use tougher universal meatshields such as [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] or [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], else he will surely advance to your base. As an Aku enemy, few non-Uber options will properly stall and control him, more so if his Shield is up. His company can easily tear apart any specialist you bring, so be wary.

Apart from his Aku trait, Vermilingua Rangmaster is also a Behemoth enemy, so strong [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayer Cats]] are good options since many can brute-force his Shield entirely. To that end, you can bring [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] to pierce his Shield, before pelting him with [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]] like other Behemoths. [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Awakened Urs]] and [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] are other particularly effective options for their high standing range. [[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Barrel Cat]] gets a notable mention, also having Behemoth Slayer and resistance to Aku which helps it to destroy Rangmaster's Shield very quickly. Beware on stages like [[Erupting Cavern Area 17]] where it could get difficult.

